{"ref":"character:astarte","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Astarte is a secret playable character introduced in the 2025 update of the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_ASTARTE"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Astarte_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[["None"]]},{"label":"Hidden weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Star_Flail.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:star-flail"}," ",{"t":"Star Flail","r":"weapon:star-flail"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Practice non-violence amongst the flowers with the charmed young Morris."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["120"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["1"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Defang","cells":[["+15%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Practice non-violence amongst the flowers with the charmed young Morris.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After unlocking ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", the player must start a run as ",{"i":"Sprite-Jonathan_Morris.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:jonathan-morris"}," ",{"t":"Jonathan Morris","r":"character:jonathan-morris"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Charlotte_Aulin.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:charlotte-jonathan"}," ",{"t":"Charlotte & Jonathan","r":"character:charlotte-jonathan"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Jonathan_Morris.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:jonathan-charlotte"}," ",{"t":"Jonathan & Charlotte","r":"character:jonathan-charlotte"},", using one of their skins to start with a weapon selector (",{"i":"Sprite-Morning_Star.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:morning-star"}," ",{"t":"Morning Star","r":"weapon:morning-star"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Coat_of_Arms.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:coat-of-arms"}," ",{"t":"Coat of Arms","r":"weapon:coat-of-arms"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Spectral_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spectral-sword"}," ",{"t":"Spectral Sword","r":"weapon:spectral-sword"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Belnades'_Spellbook.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," ",{"t":"Belnades' Spellbook","r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"},") on ",{"t":"Il Molise","r":"stage:il-molise"},". The player must skip the selection of a weapon. This will lead to the player not having a starting weapon. Then, the player must avoid defeating any enemies until the timer reads at least 5:00, then quit the run."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Astarte can be unlocked in ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"nomancandefy\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Astarte starts with +20 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"},", and +15% ",{"i":"Sprite-Defang.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:defang"}," ",{"t":"Defang","r":"powerup:defang"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["She is adept with ",{"i":"Sprite-Star_Flail.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:star-flail"}," ",{"t":"Star Flail","r":"weapon:star-flail"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["She starts with a hidden Star Flail. It is upgraded every 7 levels starting at level 7, up to level 49 when it is maxed at level 8."]},{"k":"p","c":["She can turn enemies she kills into followers if they can become one. The maximum number of followers is calculated by level/10 rounded to the nearest integer, with a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 10. The following table shows the maximum number of followers by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Max followers"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-14"]},{"c":["1"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["15-25"]},{"c":["2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["26-34"]},{"c":["3"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["35-45"]},{"c":["4"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["46-54"]},{"c":["5"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["55-65"]},{"c":["6"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["66-74"]},{"c":["7"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["75-85"]},{"c":["8"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["86-94"]},{"c":["9"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["95+"]},{"c":["10"]}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Astarte is also able to destroy light sources by touching them."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Astarte.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Astarte's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Astarte.gif","w":87,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 1 April 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Astarte's follower limit, now capped at 10 as intended (previously 4)"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 1 December 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Astarte unlock time"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["hotfix 31 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Secret check for unlocking TP_ASTARTE"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["For the maximum number of followers, because of the chosen rounding method, numbers ending in .5 are rounded to the even number. This caused the increases to take 9 or 11 levels alternatively, instead of every 10 levels."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Astarte","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Astarte"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"PowerUp-Growth.png","w":40,"h":40}]},{"k":"p","c":["Stub"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article is a stub. You can help Vampire Survivors Wiki by ",{"t":"expanding it","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Astarte?action=edit"},"."]}],"subs":[]}]}